Hi,

My 3G modem (Huawei E5) fails to setup network connection after long time '=
associating'.
By trace the debug log, it is found that the PPP is not setup. The callback=
 function at_cgdcont_cb() is not ever called, which is set to callback func=
tion when sending AT command 'AT+CGDCONT=3Dcid' in function at_gprs_activat=
e_primary();

The callback function at_cgdata_cb() is not called, thus the PPP is not set=
up. Do you have seen similiar same issue?
I paste the debug log with AT commands.

Thanks,
Best regards,
Y.A.

